 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#how-ai-search-tools-are-changing-buyer-research"&gt;How AI Search Tools Are Changing Buyer Research&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#the-main-types-of-ai-search-tools"&gt;The Main Types of AI Search Tools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
