&lt;h2&gt;How much does AEO cost across agencies, tools, and software?&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;AEO cost spans a wide range, from monitoring tools that start in the low tens of dollars a month (such as &lt;a href="https://www.hubspot.com/products/aeo"&gt;HubSpot AEO&lt;/a&gt; at $50/mo) to full-service agency programs at thousands of dollars a month (such as &lt;a href="https://revenuezen.com/pricing/"&gt;RevenueZen&lt;/a&gt;’s $15,000 Total Market package). Agency services can cost even more for custom packages. Where you land depends on how much of the work you’re buying, from simply tracking your visibility in AI answers to producing optimized content and building off-site authority.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;AEO is just one line inside a larger AI budget, so it helps to know &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/ai-cost"&gt;what AI costs across model types and tools&lt;/a&gt; before you size the AEO portion.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Most teams weighing the cost of AEO are choosing among three approaches:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ol start="1"&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;An agency that runs the program for you&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;A monitoring tool you subscribe to and operate yourself&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;A software-led, in-house setup where your own team does the work with a tool such as HubSpot AEO&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ol&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Here’s how the three AEO options compare on price, billing, and what you typically get.&lt;/p&gt; 
