&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://learn.g2.com/g2-2026-ai-search-insight-report"&gt;G2’s 2026 Answer Economy research&lt;/a&gt; found that 51% of B2B software buyers start their research with an AI chatbot more often than Google. That shift means marketing teams need to track not only traditional search performance but also how AI assistants and answer engines mention, cite, and recommend brands.&lt;/p&gt;  
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="cta_button" href="https://www.hubspot.com/cs/ci/?pg=9dd5e54b-fbef-4dd0-bc44-1689feb1ea18&amp;amp;pid=53&amp;amp;ecid=&amp;amp;hseid=&amp;amp;hsic="&gt;&lt;img class="hs-cta-img " style="height: auto !important; width: auto !important; max-width: 100% !important;border-width: 0px; /*hs-extra-styles*/; margin: 0 auto; display: block; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px" alt="Get Started with HubSpot's AEO Tool" height="58" width="335" src="https://no-cache.hubspot.com/cta/default/53/9dd5e54b-fbef-4dd0-bc44-1689feb1ea18.png" align="middle"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.hubspot.com/products/aeo"&gt;HubSpot AEO&lt;/a&gt; is one option for continuous tracking and prioritized recommendations, while HubSpot’s free &lt;a href="https://www.hubspot.com/ai-search-grader"&gt;AI Search Grader&lt;/a&gt; provides a one-time baseline. HubSpot’s guide to &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/brand-tracking-ai"&gt;AI-powered brand tracking&lt;/a&gt; offers additional context for teams building a broader measurement program.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;This guide compares six Ahrefs Brand Radar alternatives for marketing teams that need a different mix of AI model coverage, evidence, integrations, pricing, and rollout fit. It also explains how to connect AI visibility with content performance, pipeline, and broader &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/ai-marketing-analytics"&gt;AI marketing analytics&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; 
